(text "SmartBand rev A schematic.\nActivity band: steps, periodic heart rate, OLED, one button, haptic tap, BLE.\nGlobal labels carry I2C, QSPI, interrupts, and the power rails between these sheets.\nThe radio is a pre-certified Raytac MDBT50Q-P1MV2 module, not the nRF52840 die and not the PCA10056 development kit.\nThis is the circuit only. The module footprint and the antenna keep-out are still a layout job." (at 200 55 0)
  (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)))
  (uuid ce152992-741d-4549-beed-44e49cde5295)
)
